{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56803","headline":"句曲父老爲三茅君歌（题拟） · 不详","name":"句曲父老爲三茅君歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅山连金陵，江湖据下流。\n三君乘白鹤，各治一山头。\n召雨泽旱田，陆地亦复收。\n妻子保堂堂，使我无百忧。\n白鹤翔青天，何时复来游？\n（见《然而卓异记》卷二十引《总仙记》）（按：《太平广记》卷五引《洞仙记》「茅蒙」条，与《总仙记》此条前半合，知乐史当有所本。\n此诗见该条後半，未见更早记载。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}